## ErrorCodes for Automation  
The following ErrorCodes shall be used for management of functions inside automation applications.  

| Code | Description |  
| ---- | ----------- |  
| 630 | Device does not answer on Ping |  
| 631 | Device does not answer on SNMP request |  
| 632 | Addressed resource/service does not exist on the device |  
| 633 | Authentication at the device failed |  
|     |  |  
| 640 | MediatorVM (MIM) does not answer on Ping |  
| 641 | MediatorVM (MIM) does not answer on HTTP requests |  
| 642 | Addressed management resource/service does not exist on the MediatorVM (MIM) |  
|     |  |  
| 645 | MediatorProcess is not configured |  
| 646 | MediatorProcess is not active |  
| 647 | MediatorProcess does not answer on HTTP requests |  
|     |  |  
| 650 | Controller does not answer on Ping |  
| 651 | Controller does not answer on HTTP request |  
| 652 | Addressed management resource/service does not exist on the controller |  
| 653 | Authentication at the controller failed |  
|     |  |  
| 655 | MountPoint is not configured |  
| 656 | MountPoint is not in connected state |  
| 657 | MountPoint does not answer on HTTP requests |  

